      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Basic science insights along with the assessment of risk factors so clearly documented by the Canadian and Hopkins cohorts in earlier papers of this special issue have clearly led to a change in the way rheumatologists manage SLE. This review will highlight specific ways it should alter our day to day treatment of lupus patients."},
